<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>图片预览 on 404_@林达</title><link>https://linsk27.github.io/tags/%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E9%A2%84%E8%A7%88/</link><description>Recent content in 图片预览 on 404_@林达</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><copyright>404_@林达</copyright><lastBuildDate>Wed, 18 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://linsk27.github.io/tags/%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E9%A2%84%E8%A7%88/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Vue3 图片上传与本地预览的常见写法</title><link>https://linsk27.github.io/p/vue3-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%B8%8A%E4%BC%A0%E4%B8%8E%E6%9C%AC%E5%9C%B0%E9%A2%84%E8%A7%88%E7%9A%84%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E5%86%99%E6%B3%95/</link><pubDate>Wed, 18 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://linsk27.github.io/p/vue3-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%B8%8A%E4%BC%A0%E4%B8%8E%E6%9C%AC%E5%9C%B0%E9%A2%84%E8%A7%88%E7%9A%84%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E5%86%99%E6%B3%95/</guid><description>&lt;p>图片上传通常不只是把文件传到接口：用户还需要在提交前看到预览图，前端需要拦住错误格式和过大的文件，替换图片或离开页面时也要释放浏览器临时创建的地址。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>下面用 &lt;code>el-upload&lt;/code> 做一个单图上传的基础版本。&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="先在选择文件时做校验">先在选择文件时做校验
